# Membership

Read `docs/TCSA_Membership_System_Requirements.md` before implementing.

Phase 1 flow: benefits → apply → pay/confirm → activate ID → event register → admin.

- Suggested routes: `/membership`, `/membership/join`, `/membership/events`
- New models only (`ClubMember` / application / payment / status log). Never reuse `Member`
- Leave `/joinus` and `/events` public RSVP intact
- v1 identity: uOttawa email + member ID (format `TCSA-26-0001`). No password login
- Prices admin-configurable; e-transfer + VP Finance confirm is an acceptable v1 payment path
- Do not auto-penalize no-shows; do not auto-admit members to Office Tours
- Quote separately: login, digital card, QR check-in, auto refund, WeChat, i18n
- Test on mobile, Safari, and WeChat in-app browser for membership pages
